CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvstruct DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 TYPES: BEGIN OF ty_row, n TYPE i, END OF ty_row.
 CLASS-METHODS row RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE ty_row.
 CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvstruct IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD row. r-n = 42. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD run.
 DATA rows TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF ty_row WITH DEFAULT KEY. DATA row TYPE ty_row.
 FIELD-SYMBOLS <row> TYPE ty_row.
 APPEND row TO rows. READ TABLE rows INDEX 1 ASSIGNING <row>.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECVSTRUCT')=>('ROW') RECEIVING r = <row>.
 READ TABLE rows INDEX 1 INTO row. rv = |{ row-n }|.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
